sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant REST as MLServer REST<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as MLServer gRPC<br/>8081/TCP H2C
    participant DP as DataPlane Handler
    participant Registry as MultiModelRegistry
    participant Runtime as Model Runtime Plugin
    participant Metrics as MLServer Metrics<br/>8082/TCP HTTP
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector

    Note over Client,OTLP: Flow 1: REST Model Inference

    Client->>KRBAC: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate OpenShift OAuth/<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    KRBAC->>REST: HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>Token validated & stripped
    REST->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>Registry: Lookup model
    Registry->>Runtime: predict(payload)
    Runtime-->>Registry: Prediction result
    Registry-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>REST: JSON response
    REST-->>KRBAC: HTTP response
    KRBAC-->>Client: HTTPS/443 response

    Note over Client,OTLP: Flow 2: gRPC Model Inference

    Client->>KRBAC: ModelInfer RPC<br/>gRPC over TLS/443, Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate token
    KRBAC->>GRPC: gRPC H2C/8081 (localhost)
    GRPC->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>Registry: Lookup model
    Registry->>Runtime: predict(payload)
    Runtime-->>Registry: Prediction result
    Registry-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>GRPC: Protobuf response
    GRPC-->>KRBAC: gRPC response
    KRBAC-->>Client: gRPC over TLS response

    Note over Client,OTLP: Flow 3: Metrics Scrape

    Prom->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8082 (no auth)
    Metrics-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(REST + gRPC counters)

    Note over Client,OTLP: Flow 4: OpenTelemetry Tracing

    REST->>OTLP: Export trace spans<br/>gRPC (insecure=True)
    GRPC->>OTLP: Export trace spans<br/>gRPC (insecure=True)
